Package: Sphinx
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Proteomics and Histology Integrated Analysis
Version: 1.0.1
Date: 2026-09-10
Authors@R: 
    person("Mengyi", "Yan", email = "mongi126@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Toolkit for spatial proteomics analysis including preprocessing,
    clustering, annotation, adaptive spatial neighborhood networks, interaction
    analysis, differential protein testing, enrichment, and publication-ready
    visualizations. Supports common spatial platforms (for example CODEX, t-CyCIF,
    and MIBI-TOF) and provides consistent candy-style qualitative colors with soft
    sequential heatmaps. Documentation examples use a public CODEX FOV with
    ClusterName cell-type labels.
